{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25453","headline":"洛中士君子多以平泉见呼愧获方外之名因以此诗爲报奉寄刘宾客 · 李德裕","name":"洛中士君子多以平泉见呼愧获方外之名因以此诗爲报奉寄刘宾客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"非高柳下逸，自爱竹林闲。\n才异居东里，愚因在北山。\n径荒寒未扫，门设昼长关。\n不及鸱夷子，悠悠烟水间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}